HR Analytics Dashboard | CodeAlpha Internship

📌 Project Overview

This project focuses on analysing Human Resources (HR) data using Microsoft Power BI. The dashboard provides insights into workforce distribution, employee attrition, satisfaction, performance, and factors associated with employee turnover.

The objective is to transform raw HR data into meaningful insights that can help organisations make informed, data-driven workforce decisions.

🎯 Project Objectives

- Analyse employee demographics and workforce distribution.
- Understand employee attrition patterns.
- Evaluate employee satisfaction and performance.
- Identify important factors associated with employee turnover.
- Present interactive and AI-powered HR insights.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- DAX
- Data Cleaning and Transformation
- Data Visualization
- Power BI Key Influencers AI Visual

📊 Dashboard Pages

1. HR Workforce Overview

Provides an overview of the organisation's workforce through key performance indicators and visualisations.

Key areas:

- Total Employees
- Attrition Count
- Attrition Rate
- Average Employee Age
- Average Monthly Income
- Employee distribution by department, gender, job role, age group, and education field.

2. Attrition & Employee Insights

Explores employee turnover and workplace-related factors.

Key analysis:

- Attrition by Department
- Attrition by Job Role
- Attrition by Overtime
- Job Satisfaction
- Work Environment Satisfaction
- Employee Performance Ratings

3. Key Influencers & Turnover Drivers

Uses Power BI's Key Influencers visual to analyse factors associated with employee attrition.

The analysis explores factors such as:

- Overtime
- Years at the Company
- Work-Life Balance
- Job Role
- Monthly Income

This page helps identify patterns that may support employee retention strategies.

💡 Key Insights

The dashboard helps HR teams:

- Understand workforce composition.
- Monitor employee attrition.
- Identify departments and roles with higher turnover.
- Evaluate employee satisfaction and performance.
- Explore factors associated with employee attrition.

